data: {"id": "8f838f9e14dc46a0-thinking-parallel_evidence-1470", "run_id": "8f838f9e14dc46a0", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "根据已有工具结果，我对 aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-fkzvn 的事实总结如下：\n\n---\n\n### 已确认事实\n\n**1. Pod 当前状态：CrashLoopBackOff（未恢复）**\n- `kubectl_describe` 与 `kubectl_get_yaml` 一致确认：`phase=Running`，但 `app` 容器的 `ready=False`，`restarts=20`，`reason=CrashLoopBackOff`，退出码 **exitCode=78**。\n- `kubectl_describe` 事件：`BackOff` 警告持续 82 分钟、累计 354 次，说明异常长期存在。\n\n**2. Crash 的直接原因：应用进程因 CONFIG_MISSING 错误退出（非 OOMKilled）**\n- **kubectl_previous_logs**（崩溃前日志）与 **kubectl_logs**（当前日志）均返回相同三条记录，均为 `level=error`、`message=CONFIG_MISSING`、`h", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 5, "ts_ms": 1788796755576, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

